<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Mesa Verde Meets 'Em Head On, 2024</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;This scenario assumes that the United States has withdrawn&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;an extent&amp;nbsp;from its role as "policeman of the world."&amp;nbsp; Instead, the United States has helped develop a number of allied commands to deal with regional crises.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;South Atlantic Naval Force (SOLANTNAVFOR), the principal miltiary arm of the Allied South Atlantic Command (ALSOLANTCOM)&amp;nbsp;is currently on patrol off the coast of West Africa.&amp;nbsp; The Republic of the Congo has become increasingly hostile to the West and is now believed to be sponsoring terrorist activities in Europe and elsewhere.&amp;nbsp; SOLANTNAVFOR has been given the responsibility of "showing the flag," but is also on watch for any targets of opportunity.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;The Republic of the Congo has been involved in a border dispute with Gabon in the last few years, and&amp;nbsp;some of its soldiers are accused of having committed war crimes.&amp;nbsp; The United Nations has attempted to broker a cease-fire, but has been rebuffed.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;The United States and its allies believe this represents sufficient justification for limited "show of force" strikes that it is hoped will finally bring the Republic of the Congo to the bargaining table.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
